<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>By My Lonely</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Eem Triplin</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">No More Tears</ttm:item>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:11.000" end="00:14.440" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:14.440" end="00:19.940" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I'm moving 'round by myself</p>
      <p begin="00:19.940" end="00:22.470" ttm:agent="v1">I'm moving 'round by myself</p>
      <p begin="00:22.470" end="00:24.490" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:24.490" end="00:27.580" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, Wait, I'm moving 'round by myself</p>
      <p begin="00:27.580" end="00:30.610" ttm:agent="v1">He say he want beef I gun him down by myself</p>
      <p begin="00:30.610" end="00:33.590" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch I'm from the streets where I was down by myself</p>
      <p begin="00:33.590" end="00:36.660" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' Shorty all on me, She chase green not myself</p>
      <p begin="00:36.660" end="00:39.750" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I'm riding 'round by myself</p>
      <p begin="00:39.750" end="00:42.600" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch you was never there so don't you ask me how I felt</p>
      <p begin="00:42.600" end="00:45.490" ttm:agent="v1">These racks around my waist lil' bitch I rock them like a belt</p>
      <p begin="00:45.490" end="00:48.530" ttm:agent="v1">Don't wanna hear a thing lil' bitch just keep it to yourself</p>
      <p begin="00:48.530" end="00:51.900" ttm:agent="v1">My brodie riding strapped up 'coz these niggas be on some other shit</p>
      <p begin="00:51.900" end="00:55.060" ttm:agent="v1">Nigga you not my cuz' you not my fam' you not my brother, shit</p>
      <p begin="00:55.060" end="00:57.990" ttm:agent="v1">Cut ties with that bitch I can't be stressin' like my mother did</p>
      <p begin="00:57.990" end="01:00.770" ttm:agent="v1">Raised me like no other so I'm thankful for the struggle, shit</p>
      <p begin="01:00.770" end="01:03.990" ttm:agent="v1">Wanna get a mil' to feed my Grammy and my mother's kid</p>
      <p begin="01:03.990" end="01:07.040" ttm:agent="v1">Kept me outta trouble, had to hustle get this money quick</p>
      <p begin="01:07.040" end="01:09.810" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't fold under pressure bitch I'm gifted like no other kid</p>
      <p begin="01:09.810" end="01:13.820" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't under pressure bitch I'm gifted like no other kid</p>
      <p begin="01:13.820" end="01:15.320" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, and I know</p>
      <p begin="01:15.290" end="01:17.220" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch you can't tell me shit about me</p>
      <p begin="01:17.220" end="01:21.130" ttm:agent="v1">I don't, know what happened between us feelings spiral</p>
      <p begin="01:21.130" end="01:23.110" ttm:agent="v1">You moved to something different baby</p>
      <p begin="01:23.110" end="01:26.230" ttm:agent="v1">I won't, force feelings on you I ain't tripping</p>
      <p begin="01:26.230" end="01:34.230" ttm:agent="v1">Oh no, oh no</p>
      <p begin="01:36.850" end="01:39.610" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, Wait, I'm moving 'round by myself</p>
      <p begin="01:39.610" end="01:42.530" ttm:agent="v1">He say he want beef I gun him down by myself</p>
      <p begin="01:42.530" end="01:45.320" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch I'm from the streets where I was down by myself</p>
      <p begin="01:45.320" end="01:48.860" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' Shorty all on me, She chase green not myself</p>
      <p begin="01:48.860" end="01:51.630" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I'm riding 'round by myself</p>
      <p begin="01:51.630" end="01:54.570" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch you was never there so don't you ask me how I felt</p>
      <p begin="01:54.570" end="01:57.600" ttm:agent="v1">These racks around my waist lil' bitch I rock them like a belt</p>
      <p begin="01:57.600" end="02:02.490" ttm:agent="v1">Don't wanna hear a thing lil' bitch just keep it to yourself</p>
      <p begin="02:02.490" end="02:06.490" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
